naval-kapil = "2020-05-13 · Kapil Gupta: Conquering the Mind · https://nav.al/kapil · Naval and Kapil Gupta; 41 min. Naval: people asking for stock tips or book lists aren't serious; specific knowledge matters more than hard work; society runs on shared illusions individuals pay for; he knows he has found truth when a problem is solved permanently. Gupta: prescriptions can't produce mastery or inner freedom; greatness comes from unknowable processes; freedom comes from understanding where problems originate; you become your environment, so arrange it ruthlessly; chasing progress is chasing self-image pleasure; solutions lie inside the problem."
